<Project>

  <!--
    Empty on purpose, and it does not import the Directory.Build.props in the repo root.

    MSBuild stops walking up the moment it finds one of these, so this file keeps the root's build
    settings out of the tests. Those settings compile against the game's own assemblies: net35,
    NoStdLib, references out of Audiosurf2\Managed. Every one of them is wrong here.

    The point of the test project is that it needs no game, no BepInEx and no Unity, so it targets
    a normal desktop framework and uses the normal reference assemblies.

    Shared test settings, if ever wanted, go here.
  -->

</Project>
